    "doc_text": "AFP_ENG_20061205.0205\n\nDOHA, Dec 5 , 2006, 2006\n\nChina wins men's Double Trap team gold\n\n\n\n\nChina won the men's Double Trap team gold medal on Tuesday to pick up their 17th shooting title at the Asian Games here.\n\nIndia took the silver and Taiwan the bronze at the Lusail ranges.\n\nThe Chinese team of Hu Binyuan, Wang Nan and Liu Anlong finished with 424 points, 15 ahead of the Indian trio of Rajyavardhan Rathore, Ronjan Sodhi and Vikram Bhatnagar.\n\nHu, the world number two, is also expected to pick up the individual gold medal to be decided later on Tuesday.",
